> heavy load...

I than upgraded to tulip-0.90q and made an entry in /etc/conf.modules:

options tulip.o debug=1 options=16,0

to force the first adapter to use 100 Mbit (sometimes I had only 10 Mbit).
Also full duplex doesn't work all the time. I now dip switched it on the
hub. 

This configuration seem to work (since yesterday or so).

