1 3 5 ...  43
2 4 6 ...  44

I may get the rows wrong.  The 5V power pin (42) should be on the
second column furthest away from the floppy connector.  If you have a
mini-IDE like I do, the power bin on the disk should be on the second
column furthest away from the 4 separate pins.  I used it an 180MB IDE 
